SINCE: Baja 1.0
EXTENDS: BAbstractService
IMPLEMENTS: BIAlarmClassFolder, BIDataRecoverySourceService, BIRestrictedComponent
SUBCLASSES: BOrionAlarmService

DESCRIPTION:
The BAlarmService uses BAlarmClasses to route all alarm messages between
AlarmSources and BAlarmRecipients. Each station contains a single
BAlarmService.

